{"id":"664714","name":"藜麦鸡蛋饼","author":"阳台上的草莓","authorId":"7597089","desc":"","cover":"images/664714/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"藜麦","amount":"1勺"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"玉米面粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"即食玉米粒","amount":"80g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"藜麦提前泡4小时，用开水煮半小时。","img":"images/664714/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入胡萝卜丁煮1分钟。","img":"images/664714/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"藜麦胡萝卜用漏勺滤出来放凉，加鸡蛋，玉米粒，盐搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664714/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加面粉，玉米面粉。","img":"images/664714/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664714/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"平底锅放油烧热，放入面糊摊成小饼。","img":"images/664714/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煎2面金黄即可。","img":"images/664714/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/664714/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}